sequence-diagram

HR User [icon: user] > React Frontend [icon: layout]: Fill employee form
React Frontend > Spring Boot API [icon: cloud-cog]: POST /api/employes
Spring Boot API > EmployeService [icon: function]: createEmploye(employeDto)
EmployeService > MySQL Database [icon: database]: INSERT new employee
MySQL Database > EmployeService: Return saved employee
EmployeService > Spring Boot API: Return employee data
Spring Boot API > React Frontend: Return success response
React Frontend > HR User: Show success notification

note over HR User,MySQL Database: ---

HR User > React Frontend: View employee list
React Frontend > Spring Boot API: GET /api/employes
Spring Boot API > EmployeService: getAllEmployes()
EmployeService > MySQL Database: SELECT all employees
MySQL Database > EmployeService: Return employee list
EmployeService > Spring Boot API: Return employee list
Spring Boot API > React Frontend: Return employee data
React Frontend > HR User: Display employee table

note over HR User,MySQL Database: ---

HR User > React Frontend: Edit employee
React Frontend > Spring Boot API: PUT /api/employes/{id}
Spring Boot API > EmployeService: updateEmploye(id, employeDto)
EmployeService > MySQL Database: UPDATE employee
MySQL Database > EmployeService: Return updated employee
EmployeService > Spring Boot API: Return employee data
Spring Boot API > React Frontend: Return success response
React Frontend > HR User: Show success notification

note over HR User,MySQL Database: ---

HR User > React Frontend: Delete employee
React Frontend > Spring Boot API: DELETE /api/employes/{id}
Spring Boot API > EmployeService: deleteEmploye(id)
EmployeService > MySQL Database: DELETE employee
MySQL Database > EmployeService: Confirm deletion
EmployeService > Spring Boot API: Return success
Spring Boot API > React Frontend: Return success response
React Frontend > HR User: Show success notification